---
/** Off-Market Statement — zwischen Banken-Hintergrund und Ankauf */
---

<section id="off-market" class="off-market-statement relative bg-[#1c2b4a] py-24 md:py-[120px]">
  <div class="relative z-[2] mx-auto max-w-content px-6 text-center">
    <h2
      class="off-market-statement__headline translate-y-8 font-display text-[clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem)] font-light italic leading-[1.12] text-[#f5f0e8] opacity-0"
      style="text-wrap: balance;"
    >
      Die besten Objekte werden nie inseriert.
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-[480px] font-sans text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#f5f0e8]/60">
      Unser Off-Market-Netzwerk umfasst vorqualifizierte Käufer, Family Offices und institutionelle
      Investoren — diskret, ohne Marktgeräusch.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .off-market-statement__headline.is-visible {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
    transition:
      opacity 700ms ease-out,
      transform 700ms ease-out;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .off-market-statement__headline {
      opacity: 1 !important;
      transform: none !important;
      transition: none !important;
    }
  }

  /* Blendet unten in die (jetzt direkt folgende) Ankauf-Section (bg-ice-blue) über. */
  .off-market-statement::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 1;
    inset: auto 0 0 0;
    height: 96px;
    pointer-events: none;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0%, var(--color-ice-blue) 100%);
  }
</style>
